---------------------------------------------------------------------------
1. Third-party source code
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

* models/emcad.py
  MobileNetV2 backbone, adapted from
  https://github.com/tonylins/pytorch-mobilenet-v2
  (originally derived from TensorFlow Slim MobileNet).

* models/PVT.py
  PVT v2 (Pyramid Vision Transformer v2) backbone, adapted from the official
  implementation: https://github.com/whai362/PVT
  - Please double-check the upstream license before redistribution.

* models/resnet.py
  ResNet-18 backbone, adapted from torchvision
  (BSD-3-Clause, https://github.com/pytorch/vision).

---------------------------------------------------------------------------
2. Third-party pretrained weights
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

* ckpts/resnet18-5c106cde.pth
  torchvision ResNet-18 ImageNet-1k weights (BSD-3-Clause).

* ckpts/pvt_v2_b0.pth / pvt_v2_b2.pth / pvt_v2_b2_li.pth
  Official PVT v2 ImageNet-1k weights from https://github.com/whai362/PVT

* ckpts/GazeTR-H-ETH.pt
  GazeTR checkpoint pretrained on ETH-XGaze; used only as an optional
  initialization for Gaze360 training (see config/train/*.yaml).
  Source: the GazeTR project. Please confirm the upstream repo URL and
  license, and either add it here or remove the file before release.

